# Agent-Network (client)

Charter: `src/network/AGENTS.md`. Spec: REQ-MULTI, REQ-SRV-DB (HTTP).

Allowed: `src/core/*`, `fetch`, `WebSocket`. Payloads must match `CONTRACTS.md`.

```javascript
// ❌ INVALID
import * as THREE from 'three'
new THREE.Box3()
document.querySelector('#ui-root')

// ✅ VALID
ws.send(JSON.stringify({
  event: 'CLIENT_STATE_UPDATE',
  id, timestamp, pos, rotY, turretRotY, hp
}))
```

Relay pose/fire only. Do not decide collisions or damage. Do not add WS fields without a contract update.
